[["heading","F ULL-STACK SOFTWARE ENGINEERING INTERNSHIP / SECTION 26 OF 34\nTesting, QA\nand Debugging"],["heading","Complete Visual Teaching Edition"],["sinhala","","Software එක හරියට වැඩ කරනවාද කියලා පරීක්ෂා කිරීම, defects හඳුනා ගැනීම සහ root cause එක",490],["sinhala","","Jහායලා නිවැරදි කිරීම ඉJගන ගමු.",173],["heading","43 lessons"],["text","16 original + 5 previous additions + 22 new lessons"],["text","Simple English · Sinhala · Diagrams · Code · Interview practice"],["text","Requirements\nTest design\nExecute\nDebug\nRetest"],["heading","How to study"],["text","Read the definition, trace the diagram, predict the example result, and answer the interview question\naloud. Then complete the practice task."],["sinhala","","Diagram එක බලලා තමන්Jගේ වචන වලින් concept එක පැහැදිලි කරන්න. Code example එක Jවනස්",488],["sinhala","","කරලා test කරන්න.",95],["text","Examples are educational fragments unless the practical project says otherwise. Tool setups and test environments\nvary."]]